msgid "Allows the peak detection result to be delayed by up to a single frame, which can sometimes improve throughput, at the cost of introducing the possibility of 1-frame flickers on transitions."
msgstr "Mengizinkan penundaan hasil deteksi puncak hingga satu bingkai. Dapat meningkatkan throughput tetapi menimbulkan kedipan 1 bingkai saat transisi."

msgid "Always save the current playback position on quit. When this file is played again later, the player will seek to the old playback position on start. This does not happen if playback of a file is stopped in any other way than quitting. For example, going to the next file in the playlist will not save the position, and start playback at beginning the next time the file is played.\\n\\nThis behavior is disabled by default, but is always available when quitting the player with Shift+Q."
msgstr "Selalu simpan posisi saat keluar, lalu lanjutkan dari posisi itu saat berkas diputar lagi. Berhenti dengan cara lain tidak menyimpannya; berpindah ke berkas berikutnya membuat berkas sebelumnya mulai dari awal nanti.\\n\\nBawaan nonaktif, tetapi selalu tersedia saat keluar dengan Shift+Q."

